  "details": "During VR sleep people leave good morning messages with pens, sometimes a temporary disconnect happens and I'm forced to re-join the world, if that happens all messages are gone. If you are the only player in the world I would like VRC to keep the master data recorded during the previous session and then replay/sync that data so you can return to the world as you left it (position, messages, objects, etc.)",
